  "rule `no-circular` was dropped: `to.circular` is not supported (the built-in rule `no-circular` covers this)",
  "rule `no-orphans` was dropped: `from.orphan` is not supported (the built-in rule `no-orphans` covers this)",
  "rule `not-to-dev-dep` was dropped: `to.dependencyTypes`, `to.dependencyTypesNot` are not supported (the built-in rule `no-dev-deps-in-prod` covers this)",
