  "rule `lookahead` was dropped: the regex `^(?!src)` (unsupported `?`) does not convert to a glob. Rewrite it by hand, or write a JS plugin rule",
  "rule `capture-not-defined` was dropped: `to` refers to capture group `1` that `from` does not define as `([^/]+)`",
  "rule `folder-rule` was dropped: folder-scope rules are not supported",
  "`allowed` rules were dropped: oxcruise has no allow-lists. Describe the architecture with the `layers` rule, or add `forbid` rules",
  "`required` rules were dropped: oxcruise has no `require` rules. Write a JS plugin rule if you need this check",
  "`options.includeOnly` was dropped: oxcruise has no include list. Start from the right `entries` and list what to leave out in `ignorePatterns`",
  "`options.maxDepth` was dropped: use the `--max-depth` flag",
  "`options.enhancedResolveOptions.extensions` was dropped: oxcruise uses the resolver defaults",
  "`options.enhancedResolveOptions.mainFields` was dropped: oxcruise uses the resolver defaults",
  "`options.webpackConfig` is not supported; use `resolve.alias` for webpack aliases"
